@echo off
rem ---------------------------------------------------------------------
rem DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE WHILE IT IS RUNNING. NOT EVEN A COMMENT.
rem
rem cmd.exe reads a batch file INCREMENTALLY, BY BYTE OFFSET, as it executes
rem it. Changing the file's length mid-run moves everything after the cursor,
rem and execution resumes at an offset that no longer means what it meant.
rem
rem That cost INFRA-VIEWER-001 a four-hour qualification that had PASSED: two
rem minutes in, a comment was reworded; four hours later, when qualify.cmd
rem returned, cmd.exe resumed at a stale offset and called it a SECOND time,
rem truncating qualification-times.txt and overwriting three of debug-ext's
rem logs. The run had already printed "every stage exited 0" and the evidence
rem for it was gone.
rem
rem EVERY LINE OF THIS FILE BEGINS WITH rem, set, call, echo, setlocal,
rem endlocal OR @echo FOLLOWED BY A SPACE OR THE END OF THE LINE, AND THAT IS
rem CHECKED BEFORE THE RUN BY A WHOLE-WORD MATCH. P19-ARCH-001's copy had a
rem line beginning "remrem" that a prefix match let through; cmd ran it as a
rem command and printed "not recognized" to stderr. P19-FLUID-001 fixed the
rem line and the check, and the check caught the same splice once more.
rem ---------------------------------------------------------------------
rem
rem P19-GEOM-001 FINITE-VOLUME GEOMETRIC METRICS. The exact invocation,
rem recorded so the run is reproducible rather than described.
rem
rem qualify.cmd is byte-identical to the one P16-SIZE-001 settled on and every
rem milestone since has used, FIFTY-FIVE in a row counting this one. Every file
rem in this directory except THIS one is a byte-identical copy of
rem P19-TOPO-001's, verified by hash before the run:
rem
rem   qualify.cmd          git hash-object d313a64070718c44fae290ac042fe259d1a03c8b
rem   verify-harness.cmd   git hash-object 11855b8ff891093b021d1e0351761283d0eedd24
rem   launch.cmd           git hash-object f11039e6dc366d7c469a15cf74fb3867fd5ffeff
rem   preflight-space.cmd  git hash-object a65d6578000b6e8a2811d5154bcec24be09c2b54
rem   preflight-space.ps1  git hash-object 2f0d4228488f6a574ca57ec89f0fad0107b16b59
rem
rem So the ONLY difference between this qualification and P19-TOPO-001's is the
rem tree under test and the repeat filter set below.
rem
rem WHAT THIS MILESTONE ADDS. cfd gains the finite-volume geometric metrics
rem (CfdGeometry.hpp and .cpp): the cell volume and centroid, the face area
rem vector, area, unit normal and centroid, the owner-to-neighbour and
rem cell-to-face vectors, the orthogonal distance, the non-orthogonality angle,
rem the skewness, the boundary outward normal, the per-cell surface-vector sum
rem and a measured summary that judges nothing (ADR-065).
rem
rem AND ONE LAYER-0 HEADER CHANGES, which is what makes this run's repeat set
rem different from P19-TOPO-001's. core/math/Vector.hpp gains AreaVector3D (an
rem oriented area, the fifth sibling of Translation3D, Force3D, Traction3D and
rem Moment3D), the affine difference Point3D - Point3D, and magnitude and dot
rem for Translation3D. It also LOSES three additions nothing used. Every
rem change is additive or a removal of something with no caller, so no existing
rem behaviour can move -- but core is layer 0 and every module recompiles, so
rem the blast radius and not the proximity to the edited file decides the
rem regression set (CLAUDE.md section 3).
rem
rem What that ADDS to the repeat set, and why. The core math and units suites
rem were NOT in P19-TOPO-001's repeat set, because that milestone touched
rem nothing below cfd:
rem
rem   unit.RigidTransform  the rotations and reflections the covariance cases use
rem   unit.Transform       the geometry-level transform of a body
rem   unit.Point           Point3D and the distance it now has a difference for
rem   unit.Direction       Direction3D, which every unit normal is one of
rem   unit.Frame           the frame RM-MESH-06's placed body is built on
rem   unit.Unit            the unit catalogue and its conversions
rem   unit.Dimension       the dimension algebra that makes Length x Area a Volume
rem   unit.MassProperties  the existing consumer of Moment3D and Vector3D
rem   unit.SurfaceMesh     the module below cfd that does this arithmetic untyped
rem
rem Measured: 2863 tests selected by P19-TOPO-001's filter against this tree,
rem 2957 by the filter below -- 94 added. compile_fail stays EXCLUDED from the
rem repeat, as in every milestone (each case is a real compilation); the new
rem compile_fail.cfdgeom group runs in the full ctest of all three presets.
rem
rem QUALIFY_REPEAT is expanded as !REPEAT! inside qualify.cmd, never %REPEAT%:
rem a %VAR% holding | ( or ) is substituted when the for-block is PARSED and
rem closes the block early, killing the run after every preset has passed.
rem
rem THIS RUN HAPPENS ON THE HASIB MACHINE, as every milestone since P17-CLI-001,
rem by the owner's decision of 2026-10-14. GCC 16.1.0 WinLibs POSIX UCRT r4,
rem the CMake 4.4.1 and Ninja it bundles, and the dependency prefix built by
rem deps/CMakeLists.txt from the same hash-verified archives: Qt 6.11.2, OCCT
rem 8.0.1, zlib 1.3.1, Netgen 6.2.2604. The machine-specific cache values
rem (build root, dependency prefix, FetchContent source directories) were
rem configured for P17-CLI-001; qualify.cmd's plain `cmake --preset` reuses them.
rem
rem ONE TRANSIENT LINK FAILURE WAS SEEN BEFORE THIS RUN, and it is recorded
rem rather than explained away. While the 1.5 GB debug test executable was being
rem relinked interactively, alongside other work, ld exited 1; the diagnostic was
rem lost because the command's own output filter dropped every line that did not
rem match "error:" or "FAILED". Two subsequent links of the SAME objects, with
rem nothing else running, succeeded. The harness links after its compiles finish,
rem so it does not reproduce the conditions. If a build stage of this run fails
rem at the link, the stage is re-run FROM CLEAN and the result is not accepted
rem from a retry inside the same run.
rem
rem BEFORE LAUNCHING, the OneDrive client is restarted and its memory checked:
rem P19-ARCH-001's first attempt lost its debug link to a OneDrive process
rem holding 56 GB. This checkout is NOT inside OneDrive on this machine, so the
rem freeze cannot be voided by a sync; the memory check is kept anyway.
rem
rem AND THE DISK IS CHECKED TOO. preflight-space.cmd measures the %TEMP% volume
rem and the build-root volume, refuses below QUALIFY_MIN_FREE_GB, and ends the
rem process rather than reaching the qualify.cmd line below. The check is its own
rem pair of files because a comparison cannot live in THIS file: `if` is not one
rem of the allowed line prefixes, and qualify.cmd is byte-identical across
rem fifty-five milestones and is not this milestone's to touch.
rem
rem QUALIFY_MIN_FREE_GB stays at 20, the figure the owner chose on 2026-10-30
rem from a measurement recorded in P19-MESH-001's FREEZE.md: three presets from
rem an empty build root measured 11 495 MB, plus compiler scratch, ctest
rem artifacts and the GUI staging this machine cannot build -- about 12 GB from
rem empty, so 20 leaves about 8 GB free at the end. The three trees from
rem P19-TOPO-001 are still present, so this run is close to net-zero on disk:
rem qualify.cmd's :clean runs `ninja -t clean` on a preset immediately before
rem rebuilding that same preset, freeing its outputs before writing new ones.
rem Measured free on C: before this run: 2.3 TB.
rem
rem THE FRESHNESS HALF of the fresh-binary proof (the binaries are newer than
rem the clean and than the newest source) is done after the run, by hand, and
rem recorded in the evidence.
setlocal
rem
rem TOOLCHAIN PINNING, 2026-10-30, replacement machine. A fresh process on
rem this machine resolves gcc and cmake to MSYS2 UCRT64 -- GCC 16.2.0 and
rem CMake 4.4.3 -- and NOT to the pinned WinLibs GCC 16.1.0 / CMake 4.4.1;
rem WinGet's PATH shim does not even satisfy `where gcc`. Without the line
rem below the harness would silently qualify the WRONG TOOLCHAIN, and no
rem later check would catch it, because every test count, warning count and
rem subtree hash would still look exactly right. The pinned bundle carries
rem gcc, g++, cmake, ctest and ninja together, so putting it first pins all
rem five in one line.
set "PATH=%LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\WinGet\Packages\BrechtSanders.WinLibs.POSIX.UCRT_Microsoft.Winget.Source_8wekyb3d8bbwe\mingw64\bin;%PATH%"
rem
rem TLS TRUST. That bundled CMake ships no CA bundle ("no trust anchors
rem configured"), so the Catch2 FetchContent download fails certificate
rem verification and the configure stage dies before anything is built. The
rem harness runs a bare `cmake --preset` and cannot be passed
rem -DCMAKE_TLS_CAINFO, but libcurl inside CMake reads these two. This adds
rem TRANSPORT trust only: TLS verification stays ON and every pinned archive
rem hash is still enforced, so nothing about content verification changes.
set "CURL_CA_BUNDLE=C:\Program Files\Git\mingw64\etc\ssl\certs\ca-bundle.crt"
set "SSL_CERT_FILE=C:\Program Files\Git\mingw64\etc\ssl\certs\ca-bundle.crt"
set "BETTERCAD_BUILD_ROOT=C:/bettercad/bc-build"
rem 6 on the old laptop; this machine has 32 logical cores and 63.7 GB of RAM.
rem Build parallelism changes build time only -- ninja's output is the same at
rem any -j, and ctest's own -j 8 lives in qualify.cmd, which is not this
rem milestone's to touch.
set "CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=16"
set "QUALIFY_PRESETS=debug-ext release-ext debug-shared-ext"
set "QUALIFY_REPEAT_PRESETS=release-ext debug-ext"
set "QUALIFY_MIN_FREE_GB=20"
set "QUALIFY_REPEAT=architecture|unit\.Linalg|unit\.Structural|unit\.Cfd|unit\.Fluid|unit\.Provenance|unit\.CustomMaterial|unit\.MaterialFile|unit\.MaterialCli|unit\.Thermal|unit\.P18Qualification|unit\.P17Qualification|unit\.Quality|unit\.MeshDofMap|unit\.ConstraintSet|unit\.FreeEquationMap|unit\.Tet4Element|unit\.Mesh|unit\.Volume|unit\.Tet|unit\.Siz|unit\.Id|unit\.ReferenceModel|unit\.Analytic|unit\.View|unit\.RigidTransform|unit\.Transform|unit\.Point|unit\.Direction|unit\.Frame|unit\.Unit|unit\.Dimension|unit\.MassProperties|unit\.SurfaceMesh|refmod\.|gui\.|cli\.thermal\.|cli\.structural\.|cli\.mesh\."
call "%~dp0preflight-space.cmd"
call "%~dp0qualify.cmd" "%~dp0."
set "RESULT=%errorlevel%"
echo qualify.cmd exit %RESULT%
endlocal & exit /b %RESULT%
